  "description": "<p>This personalized doormat offers a unique nautical touch, featuring a custom anchor design that can be adorned with your boat name or location. It serves as a distinctive welcome mat, ideal for enhancing the entrance of cabins, ships, or docks. Crafted for both visual appeal and practical use, it blends maritime aesthetics with everyday functionality.</p>\n<h3>Product Highlights</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Personalize with boat name, family name, or location for a unique touch.</li>\n<li>Showcases vibrant maritime colors and anchor designs.</li>\n<li>Made with high-quality polyester and soft memory sponge for comfort.</li>\n<li>Includes anti-slip pads to keep the mat securely in place.</li>\n<li>Designed for easy cleaning, suitable for high-traffic areas.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Specifications</h3>\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\" width=\"35%\">Attribute</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Value</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Rug Form</td>\n<td>Doormat</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Item Shape</td>\n<td>Rectangular</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Weave Type</td>\n<td>Flat Woven</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pile Height</td>\n<td>Low Pile</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Construction Type</td>\n<td>Machine Made</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Indoor/Outdoor Usage</td>\n<td>Both</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Water Resistance</td>\n<td>Water Repellent</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pattern</td>\n<td>Nautical</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Theme</td>\n<td>Nautical</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Style</td>\n<td>Nautical</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Number of Pieces</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n</table>\n<h3>Material &amp; Care</h3>\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\" width=\"35%\">Item</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Detail</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Material Type</td>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Backing Material</td>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Product Care Instructions</td>\n<td>Spot Clean Only</td>\n</tr>\n</table>\n<h3>Where It Works</h3>\n<p>This versatile doormat is suitable for both indoor and outdoor use, making it perfect for various marine-themed environments. It can be placed at the entrance of cabins, on ships, or at docks to greet guests with a personalized nautical flair.</p>",
